  "details": "Website: I had a group member where the Avatar Icon  (default robot on other views) just would not load, so the loading animation kept playing.\n\nThis animation layer was blocking the Pencil menu to moderate the user.\n\nUsing the Inspect element to remove the progress bar fixed this (temporarily of course)\n\nSuggestion: change the progress bar layer(s) to not interfere with the moderation menu, or just disable the loading animation after some timeout, as a fallback.",
